+# One commissioned synthetic lab job — exact admission candidate review1
+
+PROPOSED, not jointly ACKed, no issuer implementation or execution admission.
+Exact bytes: C3 sorted compact ASCII JSON, reject duplicate keys/numbers/noncanonical
+bytes, max16384, frozen Grid runtime C3 structural bounds. Closed schema companion
+lab-submit-review1.schema.json. SHA256 exact canonical bytes is intent digest.
+
+Fields actor/quota are declarations to compare against genuine commissioned ROOT/
+A2 mTLS authenticated context and authoritative registry, never client authority.
+request_id is original operation UUID; job_id independent cluster-scoped stable
+UUID, allocation/uniqueness proven by authority, not an existing admitted job claim.
+No lease/fencing/assignment/resource/storage reservation IDs supplied by client.
+No caller KV path/index/current observation/leader handle/profile data accepted.
+
+commissioned_profile_sha256 must resolve an immutable owner-issued lab profile
+binding realm, exact separate SUBMIT_RESEARCH principal/current session/revocation,
+quota owner, exact source pins/input bytes, resource policy and actual worker.
+An ordinary READ_DATA credential NEVER upgrades. Profile is not a caller-created
+JSON capability. Lab realm is isolated; no authority transfers to human/Windows/
+production. Existing same Grid namespace policy/three-voter Consul, no second ledger.
+
+Input is ONLY original A7 request1126B SHA c548e2ffcd542d5d741682303694b3c6d06507740f158a6e30089b2d5355f648.
+Actual producer PR75 aed8a7c8a952f96803c207d5e90b133969a47f04,
+treeeed3a87c6e33f0993424f20b49ab5af93bd09b9a;
+strattester/research/gateway_adapter.py SHA689bd82be39cdc15725fcefbe2cefc248c4feb51c27822f9813558f5587e81dd.
+Callable execute_synthetic_research(request_bytes,*,meta_source_root,cancel_check)
+returns {'descriptor':dict,'artifact_bytes':bytes}; exact errors per PR75 ERRORS.txt.
+Underlying Meta f3c/treec155 three raw pins per producer. No A3 query bridge or
+Math-labelled local plan conversion. Declared experiment must map through actual
+commissioned registry/profile to this job/attempt; never accepted from echo alone.
+
+Resource units: cpu_millicores is reserved scheduling share, not benchmark score;
+resident_memory_bytes is requested child resident budget; max_artifact_bytes is
+output ceiling. Candidate1000/268435456/1048576 are TRIAL REQUEST DEMANDS, not
+measured safe limits/capacity/latency claims. A5 must measure actual contained
+child on commissioned stand; profile issuance/positive dispatch blocked until
+actual consumption/containment/headroom verified and owner limits approved.
+Do not change already-hashed intent after UNKNOWN; profile revision needs new
+explicit operation only after original resolution. Resource holds reduce actual
+current worker ledger atomically, pressure/freshness/health checked before grant.
+
+## Proposed owner boundary (new, approval required)
+
+A2 actual AssignmentAuthority.execute(raw,*,context,leader), reconcile(raw,*,context)
+can gain this NEW profile only after exact ACK; currently remain CLOSED. Genuine
+same-instance ConsulSessionAuthority lease required, not serialized in Gateway.
+A2 require_dispatch/verify_outcome/cancel interfaces/result codecs must be proposed
+exactly by A2; no existing supported API claimed. A5 ResearchJobs composition routes
+raw bytes to approved owner only after those contracts exist; no direct KV writes.
+
+ASSIGN transaction must include actual current actor/session/revocation/policy,
+quota, generation, real leader session+index, node registration/incarnation/policy,
+measured fresh observation/freshness marker/resource ledger+hold, child attempt,
+partition assignment/counter, job identity/full intent/globalUUID/common idempotency
+index and immutable receipt. A2 returns closed schema of actually issued records
+and independently verifiable original receipt, NOT a caller flag. Every check/write
+must appear in A2 complete native ledger with actual serialized bytes <=64ops/32768.
+Candidate schema size alone or count of family names is NOT measured transaction
+budget. A2 owns exact issuer/builder and real native tests; no fake fixture records.
+
+Dispatch revalidates actual current original grant/attempt/lease/policy/resources.
+A7 output is COMPUTED only. No job COMPLETED/charge release/result registry claim
+until actual A2 commit fence and A4 policy-compliant replica/closure publication.
+A4 result promotion API currently NONE; A7 persistence candidates still require
+actual store.stage/promote and lease verification. New cancellation original UUID
+must target this actual job; A2 orders cancel vs dispatch/result publication and
+retains original UNKNOWN/holds. Exact cancel/result/status codec is A2 joint P0.
+
+Joint next action: A2 publish actual complete captured-precondition transaction
+builder/encoded budget and result/cancel codec; ROOT approve real commissioned
+SUBMIT issuer/profile; A5 measure owned child/resource hold; A4/A7 resolve actual
+persistence seam. Then implement only approved owner paths and source-bound
+three-voter actual positive/negative tests. No broad baseline reruns needed.
